# Generated Pages sources live on the `site` branch. The render writes both
# surfaces into _gen and the workflow splits them: README.md plus the numbered
# continuation pages go to main, index.md and page-*.md go to `site`.
/index.md
/apps/*/index.md
/apps/*/page-*.md

# Workflow scratch: the render output, the site checkout and the Jekyll build.
/_gen/
/site/
/_site/
